# Comments

Write comments and XML documentation in Russian. Use English identifiers.
Write every XML summary on three lines. Put the opening tag, one short description, and the closing tag on separate lines. In Domain, follow the coverage in `domain/summaries.mdc`. In other layers, document a member when it needs an explanation.
Use implementation comments to explain an ordering constraint, an invariant or a surprising case.
